            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "一流を志すならば、\nもっとエレガントにっ！",
            "enText": "If you wish to be first-rate, you must laugh\n<i>more elegantly!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 7875129504796008409,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "おーっほっほっほっほ！",
            "enText": "Ooohohohoho!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7028997694361171207,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "なっ……これが、\n一流の笑い方……っ！",
            "enText": "<i>Gasp!</i> S-So this is what a first-rate laugh\nsounds like…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -2210021459295668183,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "私、もっと努力します！\n笑い方ひとつにしても、\n高貴な姫たるごとくっ！！",
            "enText": "Please, give me another chance! I shall\nkeep laughing until my laugh embodies\nthe elegance of a princess!!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 2239915346709834785,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "ふっ……その諦めない姿勢。\n嫌いじゃないわ。",
            "enText": "Heh… Such a diligent expression looks\ngood on you.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -3769710675794474996,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "そのまま高みを目指しなさい！\n天まで響く高笑いの頂点まで！",
            "enText": "Continue on, and aim for the highest heights!\nMay your laughter reach the stars above!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
